wf-pattern-omnitool = Omnitool
wf-pattern-omnitool-desc = A drone's multi-mode tool. Every common tool in one.
wf-pattern-jetpack-black = Black jetpack
wf-pattern-jetpack-black-desc = A sleek jetpack that fits a suit's storage slot.
wf-pattern-thermal-glasses = Optical thermal scanner
wf-pattern-thermal-glasses-desc = Thermals in the shape of glasses. See the living through walls.
wf-pattern-hand-teleporter = Hand teleporter
wf-pattern-hand-teleporter-desc = Opens a linked pair of portals. Builder work, older than the anchors.

wf-pattern-admin-glasses = Administration glasses
wf-pattern-admin-glasses-desc = Sunglasses with flash immunity that also show everyone's job icon.
wf-pattern-armored-hardhat = Armored hard hat
wf-pattern-armored-hardhat-desc = A hard hat with a light and security helmet armor. Work and fight in one hat.
wf-pattern-knockback-stick = Knockback stick
wf-pattern-knockback-stick-desc = Barely hurts, but sends whoever you hit flying. Good for clearing a doorway.
wf-pattern-clockwork-shield = Clockwork shield
wf-pattern-clockwork-shield-desc = A brass shield that blocks brute damage better than a riot shield, but burns easily.
wf-pattern-rad-barrier = Radiation barrier projector
wf-pattern-rad-barrier-desc = Projects holo barriers that block radiation. Buys time during a reactor meltdown.
wf-pattern-radio-mic = Radio microphone
wf-pattern-radio-mic-desc = Talk into it and your voice goes out on the radio show channel to every radio tuned in.
wf-pattern-thungerst-goggles = Thungerst goggles
wf-pattern-thungerst-goggles-desc = Shows how hungry and thirsty everyone around you is. A cook's best friend.
wf-pattern-multiversal-hud = Multiversal HUD
wf-pattern-multiversal-hud-desc = Security, medical and syndicate icons in one HUD, with health bars for organics and synths.
wf-pattern-ironclad = Ironclad II armor
wf-pattern-ironclad-desc = Old pod wars plate and helmet. Halves most damage and stops you tripping mines.
wf-pattern-pirate-captain-hardsuit = Pirate captain's hardsuit
wf-pattern-pirate-captain-hardsuit-desc = A heavy armored hardsuit with strong heat and blast protection. Slow, but hard to kill.
wf-pattern-mirror-shield = Mirror shield
wf-pattern-mirror-shield-desc = Reflects almost every laser shot back. Brittle against everything else.
wf-pattern-hot-potato = Hot potato
wf-pattern-hot-potato-desc = A bomb that sticks to your hand once armed. Hit someone to pass it on before it blows.
wf-pattern-laser-lmg = EL-20 laser LMG
wf-pattern-laser-lmg-desc = A full-auto laser machine gun fed from a backpack battery. Print spare batteries too.
wf-pattern-covert-armor = Covert armor
wf-pattern-covert-armor-desc = Armor vest that is invisible when worn. Halves damage and soaks most of a blast.
wf-pattern-behonker-eye = Behonker eye
wf-pattern-behonker-eye-desc = A laser pistol that recharges on its own. Never needs a charger.
wf-pattern-wet-floor-mine = Wet floor sign
wf-pattern-wet-floor-mine-desc = Looks like a wet floor sign. Explodes when someone steps on it.
wf-pattern-experimental-rcd = Experimental RCD
wf-pattern-experimental-rcd-desc = An RCD that makes its own compressed matter. Build and tear down without ever refilling.
wf-pattern-hypereutactic-blade = Hypereutactic blade
wf-pattern-hypereutactic-blade-desc = A two-handed energy blade that hits harder and wider than a double esword, but slows you.
wf-pattern-minigun = Minigun
wf-pattern-minigun-desc = A thousand rounds at fifteen shots a second. Nothing else in the sector puts out this much lead.
wf-pattern-rocket-salvo = Multiple rocket launcher
wf-pattern-rocket-salvo-desc = A rocket launcher that fires full-auto. Empties a rack of rockets in seconds.
wf-pattern-power-sink = Power sink
wf-pattern-power-sink-desc = Wrench it to a high-voltage cable and it drains the whole grid until it explodes.
wf-pattern-healing-staff = Staff of healing
wf-pattern-healing-staff-desc = Each bolt fully heals whoever it hits. Recharges on its own.
wf-pattern-cell-revolver = Cell laser revolver
wf-pattern-cell-revolver-desc = A compact laser sidearm that runs on swappable power cells. Prints the gun and one cell.
wf-pattern-century-tacsuit = Century tacsuit
wf-pattern-century-tacsuit-desc = Combat hardsuit with a spall liner that stops bullet fragments lodging in the wearer.
wf-pattern-armored-eva = Armored EVA suit
wf-pattern-armored-eva-desc = A light EVA suit with a sealed layer against chemical burns and frostbite.
wf-pattern-breaching-anchor = Breaching anchor
wf-pattern-breaching-anchor-desc = A huge two-handed anchor that pries doors open and smashes structures when wielded.
wf-pattern-mining-pulsar = Mining pulsar
wf-pattern-mining-pulsar-desc = A ship-mounted mining gun that breaks up rock. Prints as a flatpack.
wf-pattern-cell-smg = Cell laser SMG
wf-pattern-cell-smg-desc = A rapid-fire laser SMG that runs on swappable power cells. Prints the gun and one cell.
wf-pattern-cell-sniper = Cell laser sniper
wf-pattern-cell-sniper-desc = A burst-fire laser sniper rifle that runs on swappable power cells. Prints the gun and one cell.
wf-pattern-ashstorm-mg = Ashstorm laser MG
wf-pattern-ashstorm-mg-desc = A wielded laser machine gun for sustained suppressive fire. Comes with its own cell.
wf-pattern-overcharged-cells = Overclocked laser cells
wf-pattern-overcharged-cells-desc = Cells that make the cell lasers hit harder and burn out faster. One each for revolver, SMG and sniper.
wf-pattern-mantis-blades = Mantis blade implants
wf-pattern-mantis-blades-desc = Autosurgeons that fit retractable arm blades. One for each arm.
wf-pattern-sandevistan = Sandevistan implant
wf-pattern-sandevistan-desc = An autosurgeon that swaps your heart for a reflex booster. Bursts of speed, then a long cooldown.
wf-pattern-centurion-tacsuit = Centurion tacsuit
wf-pattern-centurion-tacsuit-desc = Commander's hardsuit with bone plating and a blast liner. Tougher than the Century.
wf-pattern-director-suit = Director hardsuit
wf-pattern-director-suit-desc = Heavy hardsuit with ricochet plating. Light rounds glance off and radiation can't get in.
wf-pattern-elite-pirate-suit = Elite pirate hardsuit
wf-pattern-elite-pirate-suit-desc = Heavy pirate hardsuit with a limb lock that keeps its arms and legs working through wounds.
wf-pattern-emp-ammo = EMP ammo boxes
wf-pattern-emp-ammo-desc = Ammo that fires small EMP bursts. Good against synthetics and ship electronics. 4.6mm, .45 and 5.7mm boxes.
wf-pattern-rapid-hypo = Rapid hypospray
wf-pattern-rapid-hypo-desc = A bluespace hypospray that injects almost instantly, so a medic can dose a patient mid-fight.
wf-pattern-borg-arms-module = Borg arms module
wf-pattern-borg-arms-module-desc = A security cyborg module that gives an energy sword and a heavy pistol.
wf-pattern-heavy-pulse-cannon = Heavy pulse cannon
wf-pattern-heavy-pulse-cannon-desc = A shoulder-mounted pulse cannon that can blow holes in organics, or in a ship's hull on a heavy shot.
wf-pattern-xray-cells = X-ray laser cells
wf-pattern-xray-cells-desc = Cells that make the cell lasers fire x-rays. One each for revolver, SMG and sniper.
wf-pattern-pulse-cells = Pulse laser cells
wf-pattern-pulse-cells-desc = Cells that make the cell lasers fire pulse beams. One each for revolver, SMG and sniper.
